1
00:01:36,240 --> 00:01:40,030
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,130 --> 00:01:43,070
[Episode 8: The Deadline]

3
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,190
Liang Xingfu.

4
00:02:30,250 --> 00:02:31,050
Liang Xingfu.

5
00:02:35,329 --> 00:02:36,130
Liang Xingfu.

6
00:02:36,260 --> 00:02:37,820
I heard that the entire Jinling City

7
00:02:37,820 --> 00:02:38,920
couldn't stop you back then.

8
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:40,380
What's wrong with you now?

9
00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:42,820
Liang Xingfu.

10
00:02:44,210 --> 00:02:45,640
These flimsy shelves

11
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:47,520
can't hold you back, can they?

12
00:03:38,270 --> 00:03:39,800
Be careful, Your Highness.

13
00:03:48,210 --> 00:03:50,810
Your Highness! Your Highness!
Your Highness!

14
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:53,050
The oldest of these records date back

15
00:03:53,050 --> 00:03:55,050
to the 14th year of the Hongwu reign!

16
00:03:55,079 --> 00:03:56,740
They are older than both of us!

17
00:03:56,820 --> 00:03:58,150
They must not be burned!

18
00:03:58,829 --> 00:04:00,240
They must not be burned!

19
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,240
They belong to my family.

20
00:04:08,870 --> 00:04:10,270
Why can't they be burned?

21
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,020
Look at the situation.

22
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:14,360
Let go.

23
00:04:48,530 --> 00:04:49,060
Let's go.

24
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,090
Good-for-Nothing!

25
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:14,670
Where is Liang Xingfu?

26
00:05:15,590 --> 00:05:16,390
He's on fire.

27
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:18,520
You're really something.

28
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:20,070
You saw that bastard Liang Xingfu,

29
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:21,340
but you didn't run.

30
00:05:22,980 --> 00:05:23,950
I was trying

31
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:26,910
to stall him as long as I could.

32
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:32,210
Stop talking nonsense.

33
00:05:32,210 --> 00:05:34,070
There's no time to lose. Let's go!

34
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,520
You guys go.

35
00:05:37,470 --> 00:05:39,470
Yulu was taken by the Iron Alliance.

36
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,090
I have to go save her.

37
00:05:42,090 --> 00:05:43,650
Where are you going to save her?

38
00:05:43,650 --> 00:05:45,780
You can't even stand steady right now!

39
00:05:48,890 --> 00:05:49,610
You think you can

40
00:05:49,610 --> 00:05:50,909
save your sister now?

41
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:55,960
Let's get out of here first.

42
00:05:56,530 --> 00:05:57,880
When everything is settled,

43
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,850
I will definitely help you save her!

44
00:05:59,850 --> 00:06:01,180
This is my own business.

45
00:06:01,790 --> 00:06:02,520
Besides,

46
00:06:03,030 --> 00:06:04,560
you have your own business.

47
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:06,270
But don't forget,

48
00:06:07,530 --> 00:06:09,130
you still owe me 2,000 taels.

49
00:06:10,590 --> 00:06:12,650
I... I'll help you too! I'll help you!

50
00:06:13,030 --> 00:06:14,850
I won't take a penny! I'll help you!

51
00:06:14,850 --> 00:06:15,910
You look down on me?

52
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:17,640
I don't look down on you!

53
00:06:18,090 --> 00:06:21,330
I... I'm grateful
you risked your life to save me just now.

54
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,850
I only care about money.

55
00:06:24,090 --> 00:06:25,320
Without those 2,000 taels,

56
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:26,540
I wouldn't have risked my life.

57
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:28,000
You're just a cooked duck!

58
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,350
What do you mean?

59
00:06:30,350 --> 00:06:31,350
You're stubborn!

60
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,960
Whether you love money or value loyalty,

61
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:35,820
you're just a good-for-nothing!

62
00:06:35,820 --> 00:06:36,710
Once the fire starts,

63
00:06:36,710 --> 00:06:37,820
the lake patrol will arrive in an instant.

64
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:39,510
We shouldn't stay here long! Let's go!

65
00:06:39,510 --> 00:06:41,120
-Hurry up!
-You guys go!

66
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:45,280
Good-for-Nothing!

67
00:06:45,409 --> 00:06:46,230
Let me ask you!

68
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:47,350
Since we

69
00:06:47,890 --> 00:06:50,060
fought our way out of Jinling together,

70
00:06:50,060 --> 00:06:52,659
how many times
have we stared death in the face?

71
00:06:53,030 --> 00:06:54,830
If your father were still alive,

72
00:06:55,090 --> 00:06:56,950
would he want to see you like this?

73
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:01,230
You are a useless coward!

74
00:07:01,830 --> 00:07:02,640
Coward!

75
00:07:11,270 --> 00:07:13,640
Shence Sluice is to the northwest.

76
00:07:15,410 --> 00:07:17,280
There shouldn't be
any soldiers guarding it.

77
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,940
You guys should head that way.

78
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,760
What do you mean you guys?

79
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:29,670
We're all in this together!

80
00:07:29,670 --> 00:07:30,200
Let's go!

81
00:07:30,290 --> 00:07:31,470
Stop talking nonsense!

82
00:07:31,470 --> 00:07:32,350
-Let's go!
-Let go of me!

83
00:07:32,350 --> 00:07:34,280
-Let's go!
-I'm going to save Yulu!

84
00:07:34,380 --> 00:07:35,320
Let me go!

85
00:07:36,210 --> 00:07:37,070
Get on the boat!

86
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:46,070
Row!

87
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:13,960
What's that place?

88
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:15,620
That's the direction of the back lake.

89
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:18,200
Judging by the flames,
the Imperial Archives must be on fire.

90
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:18,760
Wait.

91
00:08:19,330 --> 00:08:19,960
Follow me!

92
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:32,460
How are you holding up?

93
00:08:53,580 --> 00:08:54,350
Old Mule.

94
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:56,630
Old Mule!

95
00:09:04,130 --> 00:09:04,780
Hurry!

96
00:09:06,070 --> 00:09:06,690
Row!

97
00:09:13,130 --> 00:09:13,710
Stop!

98
00:09:22,540 --> 00:09:23,510
Zhu Zhanji,

99
00:09:24,010 --> 00:09:25,400
you little brat.

100
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:26,200
My bow.

101
00:09:32,830 --> 00:09:33,990
Keep running, huh?

102
00:09:38,700 --> 00:09:39,630
Eunuch Zhu!

103
00:09:42,230 --> 00:09:44,270
How is the carbuncle on your face?

104
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:47,710
Who is it?

105
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:57,590
Who is it?

106
00:09:58,970 --> 00:10:00,460
I've been keeping track of the time,

107
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:02,120
and I figured it was about time

108
00:10:02,250 --> 00:10:03,470
to come see you off!

109
00:10:04,110 --> 00:10:05,240
About time for what?

110
00:10:05,850 --> 00:10:07,850
For your life to end, of course.

111
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:11,200
You've been so busy with official duties

112
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,060
that you probably didn't notice.

113
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,780
The medicine I've been giving you recently

114
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:16,840
is not only useless

115
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:19,580
but will also make your carbuncle worse!

116
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:21,600
Your carbuncle is serious now,

117
00:10:21,730 --> 00:10:23,350
and the internal toxins have accumulated,

118
00:10:23,350 --> 00:10:25,440
ready to erupt!

119
00:10:25,940 --> 00:10:26,750
Dr. Su?

120
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:28,350
It's you?

121
00:10:28,700 --> 00:10:30,200
You did this to my face?

122
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:35,300
You like Fan's Roast Goose the most,
right?

123
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:38,680
I bribed the staff there a long time ago.

124
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:40,860
Every day, they make a small pot
of fresh marinade

125
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:42,590
just to cook goose meat for you.

126
00:10:42,590 --> 00:10:45,560
I added an ingredient to the marinade,
Chatou bream liver.

127
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,560
That's the reason for your illness.

128
00:10:48,110 --> 00:10:49,630
This long-term scheme

129
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,800
finally trapped you!

130
00:10:52,730 --> 00:10:54,130
Since I planted the seed,

131
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:56,000
I must see the fruit it bears!

132
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,570
That's called seeing things through!

133
00:11:00,540 --> 00:11:02,080
You bitch!

134
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:04,350
I have no grudge against you.

135
00:11:04,710 --> 00:11:06,370
Considering you're a doctor,

136
00:11:06,900 --> 00:11:08,590
I even gave you some respect!

137
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,080
How dare you try to kill me?

138
00:11:11,250 --> 00:11:13,200
Do you remember Wang Jingshu?

139
00:11:14,250 --> 00:11:14,960
Who is that?

140
00:11:17,470 --> 00:11:19,040
You really don't remember.

141
00:11:22,470 --> 00:11:24,630
She was my best friend,

142
00:11:26,420 --> 00:11:28,280
but you killed her!

143
00:11:30,740 --> 00:11:32,780
Please, let me go.

144
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:34,250
[Wang Jingshu,
Consort of Emperor Taizong of Ming]

145
00:11:33,250 --> 00:11:34,250
I don't want to...

146
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:49,630
So it was her?

147
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:52,920
She died without even leaving a name,

148
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:59,800
buried alongside the dead
as a sacrificial offering!

149
00:12:01,350 --> 00:12:03,150
It doesn't matter if you forgot!

150
00:12:03,510 --> 00:12:05,970
The poison has already entered
your heart and lungs.

151
00:12:05,970 --> 00:12:07,420
You will die anyway

152
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:09,500
without me doing anything more!

153
00:12:10,710 --> 00:12:12,570
As long as the Crown Prince lives,

154
00:12:13,110 --> 00:12:15,060
your heart fire will never extinguish,

155
00:12:15,060 --> 00:12:16,800
and you'll keep suffering!

156
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:18,800
I was blind.

157
00:12:19,470 --> 00:12:22,330
I should have seen through you,
you venomous woman!

158
00:12:26,710 --> 00:12:27,960
Before you die,

159
00:12:28,490 --> 00:12:29,750
I want you to know this:

160
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:33,230
I, Su Jingxi, will remember every woman
of humble birth you had killed,

161
00:12:33,230 --> 00:12:35,200
every innocent woman who died unjustly,

162
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:37,060
and every nameless soul

163
00:12:37,060 --> 00:12:39,190
forced to serve as a burial sacrifice!

164
00:12:40,130 --> 00:12:41,320
I will fulfill the wishes they made

165
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,780
with their dying breaths.

166
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:45,040
I will seek justice for them,

167
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:49,280
one by one, every single one!

168
00:12:50,410 --> 00:12:52,110
Even when every last one of you

169
00:12:52,370 --> 00:12:53,830
is dead,

170
00:12:56,130 --> 00:12:58,040
this will not be over!

171
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,280
You can't.

172
00:13:03,710 --> 00:13:05,310
You don't have that ability.

173
00:13:06,090 --> 00:13:07,230
You can't!

174
00:13:09,210 --> 00:13:10,080
I can't?

175
00:13:10,500 --> 00:13:11,800
Why can't I?

176
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:13,860
Not only will you die,

177
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:16,250
but you will die a miserable death,

178
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:18,140
so miserable
that going to the 18th level of hell

179
00:13:18,140 --> 00:13:19,490
will feel like a relief!

180
00:13:27,250 --> 00:13:28,110
-Stop!
-Halt!

181
00:14:21,850 --> 00:14:22,510
Bitch!

182
00:14:23,250 --> 00:14:24,840
How dare you poison me?

183
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:27,470
I'll eat you alive!

184
00:14:45,770 --> 00:14:46,990
I'll kill you!

185
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:57,150
♪ Why do the cherry blossoms
fear neither wind nor frost? ♪

186
00:14:57,170 --> 00:15:00,470
♪ Looking back on this life,
who can remain true to their devotion? ♪

187
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:04,560
♪ If this life is destined
to rise and fall ♪

188
00:15:03,330 --> 00:15:04,630
The Crown Prince is here!

189
00:15:04,590 --> 00:15:08,870
♪ Then let us break through
one barrier at a time ♪

190
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:09,390
Anyone who makes a move now will be held
just as responsible as the ringleader!

191
00:15:09,390 --> 00:15:12,880
♪ Together, let us climb over
every high wall ♪

192
00:15:12,910 --> 00:15:16,650
♪ Together, let us break through
every obstacle ♪

193
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:19,840
♪ No matter how fierce the storm,
no matter how the world shakes ♪

194
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:23,620
♪ Never think of making us surrender ♪

195
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:27,010
♪ Together, let us laugh
at the fickleness of the world ♪

196
00:15:27,040 --> 00:15:30,540
♪ Together, let us sing
until the light of dawn ♪

197
00:15:30,740 --> 00:15:33,910
♪ With you by my side, this life
has not been lived in vain ♪

198
00:15:33,930 --> 00:15:37,770
♪ Looking back at us,
all the way we have come ♪

199
00:15:38,060 --> 00:15:41,400
♪ Together, let us climb over
every high wall ♪

200
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:45,180
♪ Together, let us break through
every obstacle ♪

201
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:48,370
♪ No matter how fierce the storm,
no matter how the world shakes ♪

202
00:15:48,390 --> 00:15:52,150
♪ Never think of making us surrender ♪

203
00:15:52,170 --> 00:15:55,540
♪ Together, let us laugh
at the fickleness of the world ♪

204
00:15:55,570 --> 00:15:59,070
♪ Together, let us sing
until the light of dawn ♪

205
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:02,440
♪ With you by my side, this life
has not been lived in vain ♪

206
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:05,850
♪ Looking back at us,
all the way we have come ♪

207
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:09,190
♪ What is most unforgettable? ♪

208
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:29,280
Careful.

209
00:16:38,450 --> 00:16:39,040
This way.

210
00:16:40,110 --> 00:16:40,970
Your Highness.

211
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,300
The Book of Rites says,

212
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,960
"Preparedness ensures success,
and unpreparedness spells ruin."

213
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,290
Our escape from Jinling

214
00:16:46,330 --> 00:16:47,460
was a stroke of luck.

215
00:16:47,710 --> 00:16:49,110
Returning to the capital

216
00:16:49,710 --> 00:16:50,590
will be even more troublesome.

217
00:16:50,590 --> 00:16:52,060
We must make a plan.

218
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,490
What are your opinions?

219
00:17:09,069 --> 00:17:10,380
We must bring Dr. Su

220
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,680
along with us,

221
00:17:12,790 --> 00:17:13,310
right?

222
00:17:13,609 --> 00:17:16,270
I have already taken my revenge
at the back lake.

223
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,530
Only by serving Your Highness
on the way to the capital

224
00:17:18,530 --> 00:17:19,990
can I repay your kindness.

225
00:17:21,490 --> 00:17:22,470
That's right.

226
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:43,950
Since we are out of Jinling,

227
00:17:46,490 --> 00:17:48,290
you can stay or leave as you wish.

228
00:17:48,660 --> 00:17:50,190
I will not break my promise.

229
00:17:57,700 --> 00:17:58,270
There are

230
00:17:58,710 --> 00:18:00,360
23 Hepu pearls.

231
00:18:01,030 --> 00:18:03,360
I'll lend them to you for travel expenses.

232
00:18:04,180 --> 00:18:06,710
Don't forget
to return them to me afterwards,

233
00:18:06,990 --> 00:18:09,440
along with the 2,000 taels of silver

234
00:18:09,730 --> 00:18:10,660
you promised me.

235
00:18:13,750 --> 00:18:14,840
If I die,

236
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:17,880
Your Highness, please send someone

237
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:19,360
to use this money

238
00:18:20,870 --> 00:18:23,730
to redeem Aunt Hong
from the Imperial Music Office.

239
00:18:24,740 --> 00:18:26,500
I grew up in Jinling

240
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:29,620
and have never left
the Southern Zhili area.

241
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,420
I'm afraid I can't accompany you

242
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:33,230
that far.

243
00:18:37,230 --> 00:18:39,430
Actually, you want to go back to Jinling

244
00:18:41,100 --> 00:18:42,630
to save your sister, right?

245
00:18:58,360 --> 00:18:59,220
Your Highness.

246
00:18:59,570 --> 00:19:00,230
Please sit.

247
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:11,500
I'm fine.

248
00:19:12,470 --> 00:19:13,750
Go check on those two.

249
00:19:14,130 --> 00:19:15,280
Be careful.

250
00:19:15,810 --> 00:19:16,940
Yes, Your Highness.

251
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:23,920
What?

252
00:19:26,180 --> 00:19:28,380
-Where are you going?
-Stop pulling me!

253
00:19:30,470 --> 00:19:31,620
The Iron Alliance kidnapped your sister

254
00:19:31,620 --> 00:19:32,680
to blackmail your father

255
00:19:32,680 --> 00:19:34,340
into working for them, right?

256
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,160
Yes.

257
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:37,160
Since Liang Xingfu could follow

258
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,840
Hong Yu's trail here,

259
00:19:39,340 --> 00:19:40,310
it means the Iron Alliance

260
00:19:40,310 --> 00:19:42,420
already knows
you're helping the Crown Prince.

261
00:19:42,420 --> 00:19:42,990
Right?

262
00:19:43,460 --> 00:19:43,920
Yes.

263
00:19:45,230 --> 00:19:46,120
Then tell me.

264
00:19:46,530 --> 00:19:48,260
If I were from the Iron Alliance

265
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:50,340
and found out
you returned to Jinling alone,

266
00:19:50,340 --> 00:19:51,200
what would I do?

267
00:19:51,370 --> 00:19:53,750
I have nothing to do
with the Crown Prince now.

268
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:55,110
My sister is useless to them.

269
00:19:55,110 --> 00:19:56,510
They'll naturally let her go.

270
00:19:56,510 --> 00:19:59,310
Your sister is involved
in such a huge conspiracy.

271
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,210
If she's useless,

272
00:20:00,210 --> 00:20:02,610
they'll naturally kill her to silence her.

273
00:20:02,890 --> 00:20:04,820
You're not with the Iron Alliance.

274
00:20:05,290 --> 00:20:06,390
How can you be so sure

275
00:20:06,390 --> 00:20:07,330
they'll do that?

276
00:20:11,530 --> 00:20:12,790
My fiancé, Guo Zhimin,

277
00:20:12,860 --> 00:20:14,460
was silenced just like that.

278
00:20:14,860 --> 00:20:15,470
Dr. Su.

279
00:20:16,350 --> 00:20:18,350
You make it sound a bit too sinister.

280
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:20,950
Rectifier Yu, you are kind and forgiving,

281
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:22,820
so you can't fathom their malice!

282
00:20:23,460 --> 00:20:25,710
Then I'll collect my sister's body first,

283
00:20:25,710 --> 00:20:28,240
and then fight the Iron Alliance
to the death!

284
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:38,860
Wu Dingyuan, can you think about it

285
00:20:38,860 --> 00:20:40,390
from another perspective?

286
00:20:40,510 --> 00:20:41,970
If you don't return to Jinling,

287
00:20:41,970 --> 00:20:43,200
the Iron Alliance will definitely think

288
00:20:43,200 --> 00:20:45,640
you went north with the Crown Prince
to protect him.

289
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:47,070
This way, your sister,
as a bargaining chip,

290
00:20:47,070 --> 00:20:48,270
would be of great use.

291
00:20:48,390 --> 00:20:50,130
At least her life will be saved.

292
00:20:52,750 --> 00:20:54,550
Let me ask you another question.

293
00:20:54,570 --> 00:20:55,300
Your father,

294
00:20:56,210 --> 00:20:57,030
the Iron Lion—

295
00:20:57,980 --> 00:20:59,710
do you still want to avenge him?

296
00:21:09,470 --> 00:21:10,530
Remember my words.

297
00:21:10,790 --> 00:21:12,720
Only by following the Crown Prince

298
00:21:13,180 --> 00:21:14,880
can you avenge your father.

299
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:21,500
Come on.
Getting revenge is my own business.

300
00:21:21,940 --> 00:21:23,400
Why do I have to follow him?

301
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:25,320
You're out in the open, while the Iron Alliance
is hiding in the shadows.

302
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:27,180
How are you supposed to find them?

303
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:30,100
But they won't let the Crown Prince go.

304
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:31,970
Your chance for revenge

305
00:21:32,140 --> 00:21:33,680
will come on its own.

306
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:37,010
You insist that I follow the Crown Prince.

307
00:21:38,070 --> 00:21:40,800
Aren't you afraid
it'll be inconvenient for you?

308
00:21:42,470 --> 00:21:43,840
I'll be responsible for his health,

309
00:21:43,840 --> 00:21:45,490
and you'll be responsible for his safety.

310
00:21:45,490 --> 00:21:48,690
We each have our own duties.
How could it be inconvenient?

311
00:21:51,850 --> 00:21:52,450
Thank you.

312
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:06,890
Today is the 19th of the 5th month,

313
00:22:06,990 --> 00:22:07,850
the day of Wuzi;

314
00:22:07,920 --> 00:22:09,160
tomorrow is the 20th,

315
00:22:09,360 --> 00:22:10,310
the day of Jichou;

316
00:22:10,310 --> 00:22:13,170
and the 3rd day of the 6th month
is the day of Xinchou.

317
00:22:13,290 --> 00:22:14,150
No matter what,

318
00:22:14,530 --> 00:22:18,130
we must reach the capital by the 3rd
of the 6th month at the latest.

319
00:22:20,360 --> 00:22:22,700
At the very least, we must enter
the territory of Shuntian Prefecture.

320
00:22:22,700 --> 00:22:23,990
So we only have

321
00:22:25,230 --> 00:22:26,360
15 days left.

322
00:22:31,550 --> 00:22:32,410
Your Highness.

323
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:37,920
Thank you.

324
00:22:39,620 --> 00:22:40,440
It's my duty.

325
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:42,190
From Jinling to Beijing,

326
00:22:43,030 --> 00:22:44,090
it's over 2,000 li.

327
00:22:44,470 --> 00:22:47,050
That day falls on a day
when the Tiande Star is in charge,

328
00:22:47,050 --> 00:22:48,380
making it especially auspicious.

329
00:22:48,380 --> 00:22:50,870
If the rebels truly have their sights
set on the throne,

330
00:22:50,870 --> 00:22:52,870
they won't let this day pass them by.

331
00:22:53,230 --> 00:22:54,490
So from this moment on,

332
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:55,920
we have only

333
00:22:56,290 --> 00:22:58,030
15 days to act.

334
00:22:59,180 --> 00:23:00,470
If we take any longer,

335
00:23:01,990 --> 00:23:03,920
there'll be no point in going back.

336
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:09,200
Well.

337
00:23:11,900 --> 00:23:14,160
We can go to Fengyang,
the Central Capital first.

338
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:14,760
Fengyang?

339
00:23:25,180 --> 00:23:26,600
Fengyang, the Central Capital,

340
00:23:26,600 --> 00:23:28,530
is the hometown of Emperor Hongwu.

341
00:23:28,900 --> 00:23:31,360
It's northwest of Jinling
across the river.

342
00:23:33,210 --> 00:23:34,410
Let's go there first.

343
00:23:35,340 --> 00:23:37,000
I'm familiar with that place.

344
00:23:37,100 --> 00:23:37,960
Your Highness,

345
00:23:38,010 --> 00:23:39,270
we mustn't.

346
00:23:40,440 --> 00:23:41,900
Before returning to Beijing,

347
00:23:41,900 --> 00:23:44,160
we must not alert any prefectural office

348
00:23:44,210 --> 00:23:45,740
we encounter along the way,

349
00:23:47,990 --> 00:23:50,850
let alone reveal your identity
as the Crown Prince.

350
00:23:53,750 --> 00:23:54,550
Rectifier Yu.

351
00:23:55,360 --> 00:23:56,420
Yes, Your Highness.

352
00:23:56,420 --> 00:23:57,510
So tell me,

353
00:23:58,270 --> 00:23:59,070
do you think

354
00:24:00,460 --> 00:24:01,860
it's better to go by water

355
00:24:02,790 --> 00:24:03,920
or by land?

356
00:24:04,810 --> 00:24:06,750
Although there are official routes
between the two capitals,

357
00:24:06,750 --> 00:24:09,210
there are ravines everywhere
along the way.

358
00:24:09,340 --> 00:24:10,970
Traveling by horse on such roads

359
00:24:10,970 --> 00:24:12,940
may not be much faster than walking.

360
00:24:12,940 --> 00:24:15,710
Besides, if we encounter
rainy days like this,

361
00:24:16,180 --> 00:24:17,510
the roads will be muddy,

362
00:24:18,470 --> 00:24:20,880
and our travel time
will be even harder to predict.

363
00:24:20,880 --> 00:24:21,940
Most importantly,

364
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:24,470
if the rebels lay an ambush on the way,

365
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:26,790
we may even die.

366
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:29,840
Moreover,
your arrow wound hasn't healed yet.

367
00:24:30,810 --> 00:24:32,940
You can't endure such a rough journey.

368
00:24:35,010 --> 00:24:35,550
Alright.

369
00:24:36,640 --> 00:24:37,900
Then let's go by water.

370
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:40,030
By water?

371
00:24:42,710 --> 00:24:44,440
The waterway is also an option.

372
00:24:45,620 --> 00:24:46,710
Boats may be slow,

373
00:24:48,310 --> 00:24:49,910
but they can travel nonstop.

374
00:24:50,970 --> 00:24:52,160
Even if we cover

375
00:24:52,710 --> 00:24:54,400
only 15 li every two hours,

376
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:55,330
that's 180 li

377
00:24:55,940 --> 00:24:57,200
in a full day and night,

378
00:24:57,360 --> 00:24:58,860
24 hours.

379
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:01,550
Besides, the waterway
is smooth and unobstructed.

380
00:25:01,550 --> 00:25:02,750
So within 100 li,

381
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,470
boats are not as good as horses.

382
00:25:04,470 --> 00:25:05,270
Beyond 100 li,

383
00:25:05,340 --> 00:25:06,460
horses are not as good as boats.

384
00:25:06,460 --> 00:25:08,710
Moreover, Your Highness
can take this opportunity

385
00:25:08,710 --> 00:25:09,790
to rest quietly,

386
00:25:10,420 --> 00:25:14,480
which is far better than suffering
the fatigue of traveling by carriage.

387
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:39,210
Let's go to Yangzhou first,

388
00:25:39,250 --> 00:25:40,180
then to Huai'an.

389
00:25:40,490 --> 00:25:42,750
The terrain along this way is quite flat,

390
00:25:44,470 --> 00:25:47,270
but it will be troublesome
when we reach Cangzhou.

391
00:25:47,810 --> 00:25:49,940
However, as long as we enter Tongzhou,

392
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:52,200
we won't be far from the capital.

393
00:25:52,790 --> 00:25:55,120
I believe with Dr. Su's medical skills...

394
00:25:58,960 --> 00:25:59,680
Dr. Su.

395
00:26:01,210 --> 00:26:02,740
Is he going back or staying?

396
00:26:12,270 --> 00:26:13,670
Let's get this straight.

397
00:26:14,620 --> 00:26:16,280
No matter how far I go with you,

398
00:26:17,360 --> 00:26:18,890
once I've avenged my father

399
00:26:19,070 --> 00:26:20,270
and rescued my sister,

400
00:26:20,270 --> 00:26:21,000
I'm leaving.

401
00:26:29,670 --> 00:26:30,850
That bag of pearls from earlier—

402
00:26:30,850 --> 00:26:31,580
give it to me.

403
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:36,160
Hurry up.

404
00:26:55,900 --> 00:26:56,800
No need to count.

405
00:26:56,800 --> 00:26:58,330
They haven't been touched.

406
00:27:00,360 --> 00:27:01,420
It's getting late.

407
00:27:02,290 --> 00:27:02,880
Let's go.

408
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:44,860
Let's go to Yangzhou
and change to another boat.

409
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:46,210
Change to another boat?

410
00:27:46,460 --> 00:27:47,340
What boat?

411
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:49,310
Fresh-produce tribute boat,

412
00:27:49,310 --> 00:27:51,710
used to transport all kinds of fresh goods
to the capital as tribute.

413
00:27:51,710 --> 00:27:54,970
In the shipping trade,
they're known as Chuanshang boats.

414
00:27:55,340 --> 00:27:56,900
Since they also carry imperial tributes,

415
00:27:56,900 --> 00:27:58,360
they can display a special pass
to get priority

416
00:27:58,360 --> 00:27:59,510
when passing through
the canal barriers and locks,

417
00:27:59,510 --> 00:28:01,160
without having to wait in line.

418
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:02,360
With a tailwind,

419
00:28:02,620 --> 00:28:03,550
in a single day and night,

420
00:28:03,550 --> 00:28:05,210
it can even travel over 200 li.

421
00:28:05,310 --> 00:28:06,420
A one-way trip between the two capitals

422
00:28:06,420 --> 00:28:08,250
will definitely be completed
within 15 days.

423
00:28:08,250 --> 00:28:08,780
Hurry up!

424
00:28:09,100 --> 00:28:09,630
Let's go!

425
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:14,630
[Countdown: 15 days]

426
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:18,800
♪ Heading north a thousand miles,
treading the surging waves ♪

427
00:28:15,420 --> 00:28:17,750
[Jinling]

428
00:28:19,100 --> 00:28:23,110
♪ Fierce winds and driving rain
don't matter ♪

429
00:28:20,280 --> 00:28:22,510
[Yangzhou]

430
00:28:23,130 --> 00:28:25,460
♪ Undercurrents surge,
sails sway and toss ♪

431
00:28:24,210 --> 00:28:26,480
[Huai'an]

432
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:27,940
♪ Even with inescapable traps
set all around ♪

433
00:28:28,060 --> 00:28:32,330
♪ I insist on bringing clarity back
to this world ♪

434
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:34,690
[Shandong]

435
00:28:33,280 --> 00:28:37,030
♪ Northward, the canal winds through
the vast unknown ♪

436
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:39,630
[Cangzhou]

437
00:28:38,030 --> 00:28:41,740
♪ The lives along its banks
stir my soul ♪

438
00:28:42,030 --> 00:28:44,310
♪ Mountains may fall,
seas may be crossed ♪

439
00:28:42,780 --> 00:28:45,210
[Tongzhou]

440
00:28:44,340 --> 00:28:46,780
♪ Though we sail together,
our paths may part ♪

441
00:28:46,540 --> 00:28:48,860
[Beijing]

442
00:28:46,810 --> 00:28:51,350
♪ Still, we'll forge
a new chapter for the Ming Empire ♪

443
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:01,810
G-Get out!

444
00:29:08,230 --> 00:29:10,200
We've tried all the medicines.

445
00:29:11,840 --> 00:29:12,600
Eunuch,

446
00:29:13,030 --> 00:29:15,090
we've tried all the medicines so far.

447
00:29:15,120 --> 00:29:17,840
His yang energy is exhausted.
We are powerless to save him.

448
00:29:17,840 --> 00:29:19,920
You... you have to help me explain.

449
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:22,190
Imperial physicians,

450
00:29:22,190 --> 00:29:23,790
please think of another way.

451
00:29:23,940 --> 00:29:26,940
Well... there is really no other way.

452
00:29:26,970 --> 00:29:28,620
We must save His Majesty.

453
00:29:28,790 --> 00:29:31,420
Should we
check the other prescriptions again?

454
00:29:31,420 --> 00:29:33,350
There are no other prescriptions.

455
00:29:34,230 --> 00:29:34,790
Well...

456
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,400
Physician Jia.

457
00:29:40,430 --> 00:29:42,120
How is His Majesty's pulse?

458
00:29:45,250 --> 00:29:46,160
What's wrong?

459
00:29:46,730 --> 00:29:47,840
Say something.

460
00:29:57,810 --> 00:29:59,340
Forgive him, Your Majesty.

461
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:00,770
Physician Jia is timid.

462
00:30:00,940 --> 00:30:01,400
He said...

463
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:02,260
What did he say?

464
00:30:02,940 --> 00:30:03,710
He means...

465
00:30:03,710 --> 00:30:04,840
What does he mean?

466
00:30:10,210 --> 00:30:11,750
His Majesty might...

467
00:30:12,940 --> 00:30:13,790
He might...

468
00:30:13,970 --> 00:30:14,770
Your Majesty!

469
00:30:16,990 --> 00:30:18,790
An urgent secret memorial from Jinling.

470
00:30:18,790 --> 00:30:19,320
Leave us.

471
00:30:19,550 --> 00:30:20,680
Get out. Get out.

472
00:30:22,490 --> 00:30:23,030
Out.

473
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:35,500
[The treasure ship was blown up and sank.
The Crown Prince survived,]

474
00:30:35,500 --> 00:30:38,840
[but his whereabouts remain unknown.
Zheng He, Supervising Eunuch]

475
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:57,530
Why are you panicking?

476
00:30:59,990 --> 00:31:00,790
Your Majesty.

477
00:31:01,860 --> 00:31:03,790
His Majesty is still unconscious,

478
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:06,240
and the Crown Prince is missing.

479
00:31:06,770 --> 00:31:08,800
He met with a disaster
right after arriving in Jinling.

480
00:31:08,800 --> 00:31:09,260
Well...

481
00:31:09,270 --> 00:31:09,890
Shut up!

482
00:31:11,470 --> 00:31:13,730
How come you only saw the word "missing?"

483
00:31:13,830 --> 00:31:16,390
Didn't you see
"the Crown Prince survived?"

484
00:31:17,620 --> 00:31:19,120
Everyone was watching.

485
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:23,550
His Majesty is breathing evenly.

486
00:31:24,790 --> 00:31:27,310
Are you just like the people
outside the hall,

487
00:31:27,310 --> 00:31:28,910
wishing them dead?

488
00:31:39,050 --> 00:31:40,230
Your Highness,

489
00:31:40,550 --> 00:31:42,470
my wife is just impossible.

490
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:44,290
It's so hot.

491
00:31:44,640 --> 00:31:47,170
She could have sent something
to cool us down.

492
00:31:47,710 --> 00:31:48,810
But early this morning,

493
00:31:48,810 --> 00:31:51,160
she insisted on sending someone
to a sponge cake bakery

494
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:54,020
in the south of the city
to get a box of hot osmanthus sponge cake.

495
00:31:52,910 --> 00:31:56,850
[Lord Song, Vice Minister of Rites]

496
00:31:55,290 --> 00:31:57,070
It's too sweet for me.

497
00:31:57,110 --> 00:32:02,450
[Zhu Gaoxi, Prince of Han]

498
00:31:57,290 --> 00:31:59,120
Would you like to try some?

499
00:32:01,110 --> 00:32:01,830
Let me.

500
00:32:10,210 --> 00:32:11,840
It is cloyingly sweet.

501
00:32:14,550 --> 00:32:15,470
I like it.

502
00:32:15,970 --> 00:32:17,310
As long as you like it.

503
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:19,300
I'll have her send more next time.

504
00:32:20,660 --> 00:32:21,270
San!

505
00:32:21,940 --> 00:32:22,640
San!

506
00:32:24,010 --> 00:32:24,510
Come.

507
00:32:24,910 --> 00:32:27,380
Distribute this sponge cake
to the lords here.

508
00:32:27,380 --> 00:32:28,420
Let everyone have a taste.

509
00:32:28,420 --> 00:32:29,820
Let's enjoy it together!

510
00:32:30,790 --> 00:32:32,250
Thank you, Your Highness.

511
00:32:38,710 --> 00:32:39,910
To tell you the truth,

512
00:32:39,990 --> 00:32:41,990
this is exactly the kind of flavor I like.

513
00:32:41,990 --> 00:32:44,320
So she actually sent over the right thing.

514
00:32:45,180 --> 00:32:46,180
Where do you live?

515
00:32:46,440 --> 00:32:47,670
Thank you, Your Highness.

516
00:32:47,670 --> 00:32:49,800
I live in Nanluogu Lane in the capital.

517
00:32:51,750 --> 00:32:54,230
It's good to have a home in the capital.

518
00:32:54,530 --> 00:32:55,400
Yes, yes.

519
00:32:55,840 --> 00:33:00,170
A plain-looking wife and fields close to home
are life's greatest treasures.

520
00:33:02,100 --> 00:33:03,200
Say it again.

521
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:04,990
Who sent the peaches?

522
00:33:08,620 --> 00:33:09,160
These...

523
00:33:11,030 --> 00:33:12,230
These... These...

524
00:33:12,570 --> 00:33:14,250
These are...

525
00:33:14,640 --> 00:33:15,970
Yangshan honey peaches

526
00:33:16,440 --> 00:33:18,470
sent...

527
00:33:18,700 --> 00:33:22,410
[Crown Princess]

528
00:33:19,270 --> 00:33:20,230
sent by...

529
00:33:21,460 --> 00:33:24,030
the Crown Prince...

530
00:33:25,120 --> 00:33:26,600
from Wuxi County.

531
00:33:27,270 --> 00:33:28,130
Honey peaches.

532
00:33:29,510 --> 00:33:31,770
He specially ordered me... to bring them

533
00:33:32,710 --> 00:33:34,630
for... the ministers to taste.

534
00:33:35,470 --> 00:33:36,380
And then?

535
00:33:37,350 --> 00:33:39,480
Your Majesty, Zhao Heng has returned.

536
00:33:39,740 --> 00:33:40,650
Let him wait.

537
00:33:42,860 --> 00:33:43,920
Don't panic.

538
00:33:44,140 --> 00:33:45,070
Say it again.

539
00:33:45,250 --> 00:33:46,880
Who sent the honey peaches?

540
00:33:47,710 --> 00:33:48,550
Your Majesty.

541
00:33:49,790 --> 00:33:50,940
These are...

542
00:33:52,510 --> 00:33:53,230
are...

543
00:33:54,290 --> 00:33:55,790
Yangshan...

544
00:33:56,290 --> 00:33:57,820
Yangshan honey peaches...

545
00:33:58,510 --> 00:34:01,640
presented by the magistrate of Wuxi...

546
00:34:03,030 --> 00:34:04,030
of Wuxi...

547
00:34:04,790 --> 00:34:08,400
when he paid... his respects
to the Crown Prince in Jinling.

548
00:34:09,199 --> 00:34:11,070
Out of consideration for...

549
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:13,219
for...

550
00:34:16,090 --> 00:34:18,800
the ministers
of the various government offices...

551
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:19,730
the Crown Prince...

552
00:34:19,730 --> 00:34:20,389
Your Majesty.

553
00:34:20,389 --> 00:34:21,230
I heard you!

554
00:34:25,969 --> 00:34:26,989
Leave.

555
00:34:28,350 --> 00:34:29,620
Useless fool.

556
00:34:31,010 --> 00:34:32,670
Haishou, did you understand?

557
00:34:34,150 --> 00:34:35,630
I did.

558
00:34:36,670 --> 00:34:38,030
Then why don't you deliver them already?

559
00:34:38,030 --> 00:34:39,690
Are you waiting for me to do it?

560
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:41,500
I'll go right away.

561
00:34:41,590 --> 00:34:42,650
I'll go right away.

562
00:34:55,320 --> 00:34:57,470
My Lords, the Crown Prince bestows

563
00:34:57,650 --> 00:34:59,550
Wuxi honey peaches upon you!

564
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:05,750
♪ The Golden Hall stands grand and wide ♪

565
00:35:05,830 --> 00:35:08,070
♪ Towers shrouded
deep in clouds and mist ♪

566
00:35:08,270 --> 00:35:10,690
♪ They call me the Crown Prince ♪

567
00:35:08,370 --> 00:35:09,860
It's from the Crown Prince.

568
00:35:09,860 --> 00:35:10,510
Lord Liu.

569
00:35:10,790 --> 00:35:13,320
♪ But I hide by the Qinhuai River ♪

570
00:35:11,670 --> 00:35:12,800
It's from the Crown Prince.

571
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:13,360
Lord Du.

572
00:35:14,780 --> 00:35:16,300
It's from the Crown Prince.

573
00:35:16,300 --> 00:35:16,920
Thank you.

574
00:35:18,340 --> 00:35:18,920
My Lord.

575
00:35:18,370 --> 00:35:20,720
♪ Those high in court know
nothing of the world below ♪

576
00:35:20,460 --> 00:35:21,470
It's from the Crown Prince.

577
00:35:20,760 --> 00:35:23,080
♪ The storms outside
are just tales to them ♪

578
00:35:23,220 --> 00:35:25,720
♪ Take off this robe,
and I'm just a stranger ♪

579
00:35:25,130 --> 00:35:26,440
Don't you think so?

580
00:35:25,750 --> 00:35:28,190
♪ But when urgent word
comes from home up north ♪

581
00:35:27,840 --> 00:35:28,470
My Lord.

582
00:35:28,220 --> 00:35:30,680
♪ I'll brave a thousand miles to fight ♪

583
00:35:29,670 --> 00:35:30,800
It's from the Crown Prince.

584
00:35:30,780 --> 00:35:32,750
♪ To fight ♪

585
00:35:35,070 --> 00:35:35,840
Lord Lyu.

586
00:35:36,490 --> 00:35:38,020
It's from the Crown Prince.

587
00:35:47,470 --> 00:35:48,550
Your Highness.

588
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:53,430
Peaches from Wuxi?

589
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:56,390
They must have come by canal transport.

590
00:35:56,390 --> 00:35:57,990
It's not easy to get them here

591
00:35:58,160 --> 00:35:59,160
without rotting.

592
00:36:01,560 --> 00:36:02,580
Leave them here.

593
00:36:05,550 --> 00:36:06,150
Yes.

594
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:15,920
Come on. Shall we?

595
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:17,190
Alright.

596
00:36:24,400 --> 00:36:25,280
It's so crisp.

597
00:36:26,210 --> 00:36:28,310
Isn't this Pinggu white peach?

598
00:36:28,570 --> 00:36:29,960
What honey peach?

599
00:36:34,530 --> 00:36:37,110
Thank you, Your Highness!

600
00:36:37,550 --> 00:36:40,400
Thank you, Your Highness!

601
00:36:41,150 --> 00:36:44,030
[Liu Sichang, Left Censor-in-Chief]

602
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:43,550
I, Left Censor-in-Chief Liu Sichang,

603
00:36:43,630 --> 00:36:46,150
thank Your Highness for the reward!

604
00:36:47,690 --> 00:36:50,590
Thank you, Your Highness!

605
00:36:55,460 --> 00:36:56,320
Your Majesty!

606
00:36:56,740 --> 00:36:57,590
Your Majesty!

607
00:36:58,880 --> 00:36:59,650
Your Majesty!

608
00:36:59,650 --> 00:37:01,820
Something bad happened, Your Majesty!

609
00:37:01,820 --> 00:37:02,620
Your Majesty!

610
00:37:02,970 --> 00:37:04,470
Something terrible has happened,

611
00:37:04,470 --> 00:37:05,280
Your Majesty!

612
00:37:06,880 --> 00:37:08,630
Bad news, Your Majesty!

613
00:37:09,400 --> 00:37:10,320
Your Majesty!

614
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:12,920
Your Highness.

615
00:37:13,420 --> 00:37:16,950
Isn't this Eunuch Zhao
from the Crown Prince's Eastern Palace?

616
00:37:17,580 --> 00:37:18,920
Who is Eunuch Zhao?

617
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:04,240
Stop crying.

618
00:38:07,350 --> 00:38:08,020
Hold him up.

619
00:38:11,580 --> 00:38:12,260
Hold him up.

620
00:38:13,930 --> 00:38:15,390
[Zhao Heng,
Eunuch from the Eastern Palace]

621
00:38:18,650 --> 00:38:19,280
Tell me,

622
00:38:20,050 --> 00:38:21,670
what exactly happened to the Crown Prince?

623
00:38:21,670 --> 00:38:22,630
Your Majesty.

624
00:38:23,490 --> 00:38:25,530
After the treasure ship was blown up
and sank,

625
00:38:25,530 --> 00:38:26,110
I...

626
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:30,760
I never saw His Highness again!

627
00:38:31,720 --> 00:38:33,050
You never saw him again?

628
00:38:33,860 --> 00:38:36,300
And you dare to say
the Crown Prince has passed away?

629
00:38:36,300 --> 00:38:38,160
Your Majesty, please see reason!

630
00:38:39,110 --> 00:38:39,660
Your Majesty.

631
00:38:39,660 --> 00:38:41,490
It was Eunuch Zhu Buhua, Commander

632
00:38:41,490 --> 00:38:42,800
of the Directorate of the Imperial Stables
in Jinling,

633
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:44,020
who personally picked up the jade pendant

634
00:38:44,020 --> 00:38:44,970
and the ceremonial robe

635
00:38:44,970 --> 00:38:46,110
and gave them to me.

636
00:38:46,150 --> 00:38:48,540
And he said that after the treasure ship
was blown up,

637
00:38:48,540 --> 00:38:50,470
His Highness was gravely injured.

638
00:38:50,690 --> 00:38:52,220
Despite their best efforts to save him...

639
00:38:52,220 --> 00:38:52,920
Shut up!

640
00:38:57,820 --> 00:39:00,550
Is this how you've been shouting
all the way here?

641
00:39:00,840 --> 00:39:01,760
Your Majesty...

642
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:02,440
You tell me.

643
00:39:03,460 --> 00:39:04,260
Your Majesty.

644
00:39:04,610 --> 00:39:06,760
Eunuch Zhao arrived at Guangqu Gate
last night.

645
00:39:06,760 --> 00:39:08,690
The guards refused to let him pass,

646
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:11,060
so he argued with them for half the night.

647
00:39:11,380 --> 00:39:14,510
But they waited
until the city gates opened this morning

648
00:39:14,860 --> 00:39:16,360
to let us in.

649
00:39:17,670 --> 00:39:19,260
You made a scene at the city gate

650
00:39:19,260 --> 00:39:20,490
for half the night?

651
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:25,870
Were you trying
to make sure everyone in this hall

652
00:39:25,870 --> 00:39:29,170
knew something had happened
to the Crown Prince in Jinling?

653
00:39:29,170 --> 00:39:29,970
Your Majesty.

654
00:39:30,460 --> 00:39:32,460
The Crown Prince has been in danger.

655
00:39:32,590 --> 00:39:34,380
It's a matter of great importance.

656
00:39:34,380 --> 00:39:36,240
What are you hoping to achieve

657
00:39:36,610 --> 00:39:38,800
by making such a public spectacle of this?

658
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:40,400
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

659
00:39:40,670 --> 00:39:41,280
I...

660
00:39:41,550 --> 00:39:42,470
I was just...

661
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:44,360
overwhelmed with grief

662
00:39:44,940 --> 00:39:46,840
and lost my mind for a moment,
Your Majesty!

663
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:49,280
I don't think you lost your mind.

664
00:39:50,510 --> 00:39:52,550
Only your real master knows

665
00:39:53,280 --> 00:39:55,700
what you are really thinking.

666
00:39:57,260 --> 00:39:58,190
Your Majesty...

667
00:39:58,490 --> 00:39:59,190
Guards.

668
00:39:59,670 --> 00:40:01,200
This wretched servant Zhao

669
00:40:01,630 --> 00:40:02,670
must have heard some rumor

670
00:40:02,670 --> 00:40:03,800
somewhere

671
00:40:04,340 --> 00:40:05,540
and spread it as fact,

672
00:40:05,550 --> 00:40:07,030
stirring up trouble
and misleading everyone.

673
00:40:07,030 --> 00:40:08,240
You know what to do with him,

674
00:40:08,240 --> 00:40:09,470
don't you?

675
00:40:10,650 --> 00:40:11,470
Take him away.

676
00:40:11,740 --> 00:40:13,340
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

677
00:40:13,460 --> 00:40:15,550
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

678
00:40:17,720 --> 00:40:18,720
Your Majesty!

679
00:40:27,570 --> 00:40:28,770
All of you, come here.

680
00:40:36,170 --> 00:40:36,990
You've been

681
00:40:38,250 --> 00:40:40,500
serving me since His Majesty

682
00:40:41,030 --> 00:40:42,560
was still the Crown Prince.

683
00:40:44,770 --> 00:40:45,580
I don't need to remind you

684
00:40:45,580 --> 00:40:46,790
what you should

685
00:40:47,990 --> 00:40:48,750
and shouldn't listen to,

686
00:40:48,750 --> 00:40:49,950
or what you should

687
00:40:50,720 --> 00:40:52,680
and shouldn't say, right?

688
00:40:52,990 --> 00:40:53,820
Yes.

689
00:41:30,550 --> 00:41:31,350
Your Majesty?

690
00:41:35,990 --> 00:41:37,920
It does belong to the Crown Prince.

691
00:41:40,380 --> 00:41:41,180
Your Majesty.

692
00:41:42,070 --> 00:41:42,870
Your Majesty.

693
00:43:08,900 --> 00:43:09,720
Understood.
